        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive a non-stop barrage of missiles in this sci-fi survival against death!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARHEAD CIRCUS is a survival roguelike where you use afterburners and barrel rolls to evade missiles on unpredictable trajectories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the controls of your fighter and survive with 100% synch rate using your player skills!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936260/extras/91530a43bc7fa5fb62dd393140da0be0.poster.avif?t=1765875921\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936260/extras/91530a43bc7fa5fb62dd393140da0be0.webm?t=1765875921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936260/extras/91530a43bc7fa5fb62dd393140da0be0.mp4?t=1765875921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power up by attacks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your machine guns will automatically fire when you are near the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack enemies to gain experience points that you can use to upgrade your jet fighter! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're all alone! No one's coming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive a non-stop barrage of missiles in this sci-fi survival against death!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARHEAD CIRCUS is a survival roguelike where you use afterburners and barrel rolls to evade missiles on unpredictable trajectories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the controls of your fighter and survive with 100% synch rate using your player skills!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936260/extras/91530a43bc7fa5fb62dd393140da0be0.poster.avif?t=1765875921\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936260/extras/91530a43bc7fa5fb62dd393140da0be0.webm?t=1765875921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936260/extras/91530a43bc7fa5fb62dd393140da0be0.mp4?t=1765875921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power up by attacks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your machine guns will automatically fire when you are near the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack enemies to gain experience points that you can use to upgrade your jet fighter! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're all alone! No one's coming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive?</p>",
